---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>About this place 🏡</h1>
      <p>Where {SITE.author} thinks out loud.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This is a blog for thoughts about things — big things, small things, things that probably didn't need a chart but got one anyway.</p>
      <p>Most posts come with <strong>interactive charts</strong>. Some of them argue back: slide the hot-take meters, drag dots around the 2×2s, draw your guess before the real line shows up, or reshuffle a tier list and see how much we disagree.</p>
      <blockquote>Your answers stay in your own browser. Nobody's keeping score. (Except the charts. The charts are keeping score.)</blockquote>
      <p>Want to make one? Have a play in the <a href="/chart-lab/">Chart Lab</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
